    // A statement expression ({ ... }) that runs the first block whose test
    // holds and has its value. subject, if not uninvited, is the code that sets
    // the temporary t first. Its lines are emitted into out, then taken back off.
    ;scheme (e, t, subject)branchValue {
        ;out($length) claim start
        ;indent claim savedIndent
        ;loops claim savedLoops
        ;iife claim savedIife
        ;savedIndent + wah cheat indent
        ;wh cheat loops
